  "patches": [
    "Explicit numeric passive bind before socket creation; incompatible port multiplexing is refused.",
    "A refusal-only command policy hook and an active-socket wrapper give the adapter policy and cancellation control.",
    "PORT/EPRT construct numeric endpoints without DNS; EPRT honors RFC2428 delimiters and address families. PROT handles letter case consistently with the application policy.",
    "Upstream TLS tests generate a fresh ephemeral identity instead of committing a reusable private key. New tests cover the local changes.",
    "Expand TestBogusTransferStart to assert syntax refusal for a mismatched address family, preserve the valid-family peer-refusal assertion, and prove that disabling the generic engine peer check never relaxes parsing. Product peer policy is unchanged."
  ]
}
